    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gamma Strain is a <strong>cooperative third-person horror shooter</strong>.  Battle through hordes of different types of mutated anomalies, customize your character and gear, and level-up as you try to contain this ever-growing threat. Teamwork, tactics, and flawless execution are key to your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/c4c486bf8722adb12ef8856b3cd6cd2e.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/c4c486bf8722adb12ef8856b3cd6cd2e.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/c4c486bf8722adb12ef8856b3cd6cd2e.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f4aa1f3078918999f213d5c90b792178.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>If your squad dies, you\u2019ll have to restart. (permadeath). When you restart your new mission is shown but ALSO the location of the previously fallen squad is shown. You can choose to go to the fallen squad location and retrieve their digital biometric dog tags and potential gear.<br><br>If you do this- the XP that that squad gained is added to your XP upon a successful extraction. <br>If you die on this run, then you lose everything. When you restart the game, the prior fallen squads are no longer shown. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f811f6853c28f40f3e0a233506b62eca.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f811f6853c28f40f3e0a233506b62eca.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f811f6853c28f40f3e0a233506b62eca.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/e07856030827f24e8699abd70a4d914a.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Choose to extract or continue. Increasing the potential rewards, but simultaneously increasing the potential risk. Players can choose to continue playing and get more loot and XP, or play it safe and end the run.  If you wipe, no XP is gained. <strong>High Risk. High Reward.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/4b9f6b5db293f0578cc3379bc06a26bf.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/4b9f6b5db293f0578cc3379bc06a26bf.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/4b9f6b5db293f0578cc3379bc06a26bf.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/8b02db26d612bf540dbde63677bdf19e.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Operators can only go into &quot;the zone&quot; ONCE. Similar to the protocols developed during the  <i>Chernobyl incident</i>.  These protocols limit exposure, due to the unknown and potential contamination risks. <br><br>That means each time a fresh squad is sent in. There is no individual Operator progression, but rather <strong>Class Progression</strong>. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/7abfc9e1439173d4ac323faeff359850.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/7abfc9e1439173d4ac323faeff359850.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/7abfc9e1439173d4ac323faeff359850.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f58154ce72b66f2cf6edcd01d54daa6a.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>When a squad member is downed and not revived in time, they are dragged away to the next nearest nest. <br><br>They can be rescued before they are assimilated, but time is a factor. If all soldiers are downed, they are all taken to the nest, and the game session is over. <br><br><strong><i>\u201cGame over, man. Game over.\u201d</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gamma Strain is a <strong>cooperative third-person horror shooter</strong>.  Battle through hordes of different types of mutated anomalies, customize your character and gear, and level-up as you try to contain this ever-growing threat. Teamwork, tactics, and flawless execution are key to your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/c4c486bf8722adb12ef8856b3cd6cd2e.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/c4c486bf8722adb12ef8856b3cd6cd2e.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/c4c486bf8722adb12ef8856b3cd6cd2e.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f4aa1f3078918999f213d5c90b792178.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>If your squad dies, you\u2019ll have to restart. (permadeath). When you restart your new mission is shown but ALSO the location of the previously fallen squad is shown. You can choose to go to the fallen squad location and retrieve their digital biometric dog tags and potential gear.<br><br>If you do this- the XP that that squad gained is added to your XP upon a successful extraction. <br>If you die on this run, then you lose everything. When you restart the game, the prior fallen squads are no longer shown. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f811f6853c28f40f3e0a233506b62eca.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f811f6853c28f40f3e0a233506b62eca.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f811f6853c28f40f3e0a233506b62eca.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/e07856030827f24e8699abd70a4d914a.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Choose to extract or continue. Increasing the potential rewards, but simultaneously increasing the potential risk. Players can choose to continue playing and get more loot and XP, or play it safe and end the run.  If you wipe, no XP is gained. <strong>High Risk. High Reward.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/4b9f6b5db293f0578cc3379bc06a26bf.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/4b9f6b5db293f0578cc3379bc06a26bf.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/4b9f6b5db293f0578cc3379bc06a26bf.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/8b02db26d612bf540dbde63677bdf19e.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Operators can only go into &quot;the zone&quot; ONCE. Similar to the protocols developed during the  <i>Chernobyl incident</i>.  These protocols limit exposure, due to the unknown and potential contamination risks. <br><br>That means each time a fresh squad is sent in. There is no individual Operator progression, but rather <strong>Class Progression</strong>. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/7abfc9e1439173d4ac323faeff359850.poster.avif?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/7abfc9e1439173d4ac323faeff359850.webm?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/7abfc9e1439173d4ac323faeff359850.mp4?t=1719473899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657270/extras/f58154ce72b66f2cf6edcd01d54daa6a.webp?t=1719473899\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>When a squad member is downed and not revived in time, they are dragged away to the next nearest nest. <br><br>They can be rescued before they are assimilated, but time is a factor. If all soldiers are downed, they are all taken to the nest, and the game session is over. <br><br><strong><i>\u201cGame over, man. Game over.\u201d</i></strong>",
